\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Good Christian men, rejoice
\par With heart and soul and voice
\par Give ye heed to what we say:
\par  News! News!
\par Jesus Christ is born to-day.
\par Ox and ass before Him bow,
\par And He is in the manger now:
\par Christ is born to-day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Good Christian men, rejoice
\par With heart and soul and voice
\par Now ye hear of endless bliss
\par Joy! Joy!
\par Jesus Christ was born for this.
\par He hath opened the heavenly door,
\par And man is blest for evermore.
\par Christ was born for this.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Good Christian men rejoice
\par With heart and soul and voice
\par Now ye need not fear the grace
\par Peace! Peace!
\par Jesus Christ was born to save
\par Calls you one, and calls you all,
\par To gain His everlasting hall.
\par Christ was born to save.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

